# Everything is excluded, then the shipped artifacts are named explicitly.
# An allowlist is the only form that stays correct when someone adds a new
# directory next year: the default is "not in the VSIX", which is the answer
# that cannot leak sources or a stray .env into a published package.
**/*

!dist/extension.js
!media/icon.png
!media/arcturn-activity.svg
# The walkthrough's prose. Without this line it packages as empty steps, and
# only a published install would show it — `manifest.test.ts` guards the pair.
!media/walkthrough/*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
